      "quote": "The device shall implement role-based authorization such that users and services are granted only the minimum privileges required for their function (principle of least privilege). Administrative functions shall be separated from clinical use.",
      "reason": "No existing controls address role-based authorization or the principle of least privilege."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "AAMI-TIR57-7.1",
      "verdict": "missing",
      "quote": "The manufacturer shall establish a post-market process to monitor emerging vulnerabilities that may affect the device, to assess their applicability, and to communicate mitigations to users and, when appropriate, regulators.",
